[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6733.51, "timestamp": "01:52:13", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6751.43, "timestamp": "01:52:31", "text": "來看你的鯊魚，謝謝你，恐龍。這意義重大。說實話，我很高興你每天都來。謝謝"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6764.87, "timestamp": "01:52:44", "text": "雞的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6768.229, "timestamp": "01:52:48", "text": "日誌檔。那大概是關鍵的一擊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6771.35, "timestamp": "01:52:51", "text": "我當時真是個傻瓜，在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6773.83, "timestamp": "01:52:53", "text": "Christina的踢腿擴充功能對我不起作用之前，我做了些東西，因為雲集了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6777.03, "timestamp": "01:52:57", "text": "。不。所以"}]